# Home Finance OS (HFOS)

## Changelog

All notable changes to Home Finance OS are documented in this file.

This project follows a sprint-based development process.

---

## [0.40.0-alpha] - 2026-07-22

### Added

* Added Sprint 40 notes and release notes for auth and cloud decision prep.
* Documented that Google Drive backup remains disabled unless
  `VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` is configured for the Cloudflare Pages build.

### Changed

* Updated the product roadmap from deployed beta hardening to auth and cloud
  decision prep.

### Verified

* Pending Sprint 40 validation.

